---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Page non trouvée - SaaSDeals">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="text-8xl mb-6">🔍</div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Oups ! Page introuvable</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8">
      La page que vous cherchez n'existe pas ou a été déplacée.
    </p>

    <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Peut-être cherchiez-vous :</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/comparatif/email-marketing" class="bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition">📧 Email</a>
        <a href="/comparatif/crm" class="bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition">👥 CRM</a>
        <a href="/comparatif/outils-ia" class="bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition">🤖 IA</a>
        <a href="/comparatif/compta-finance" class="bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition">💰 Compta</a>
        <a href="/codes-promo" class="bg-gold/20 text-gold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-gold/30 transition">🎁 Promos</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-gold text-gray-900 px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition">
      ← Retour à l'accueil
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
